    "title": "Bodine has big day in Cumberland's win over Highland - Girls soccer recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Cosentino ,\n1 hours ago Ellie Bodine had her first career four-goal game and added an assist to lead Cumberland past Highland 6-1 in Seabrook. Emily Sheldon added two goals and an assist and Mackenzie Upham made 11 saves for the Colts (1-1). Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
